message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: pycmdcheck
authors:
  - given-names: James Joseph
    family-names: Balamuta
repository-code: "https://github.com/coatless-py-pkg/pycmdcheck"
url: "https://py-pkg.thecoatlessprofessor.com/pycmdcheck/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  pycmdcheck runs a set of quality checks on a Python package, modelled on
  R CMD check. It looks at metadata, structure, tests, linting, typing,
  documentation and more, and reports the results on the command line, as
  JSON, or through a Python API.
